      "source": "Creates a new, uninitialized <a href=\"OxmSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>OxmSerializer</code></a>. Requires <a href=\"#setMarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Marshaller)\"><code>setMarshaller(Marshaller)</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#setUnmarshaller(org.springframework.oxm.Unmarshaller)\"><code>setUnmarshaller(Unmarshaller)</code></a> to be set before this serializer can be used.",
